  "description": "StrikeLInk is a modern .NET library for Counter-Strike 2 and Valve ecosystem integration.\nIt provides event-driven access to in-game chat, game state updates, Steam client services, CS2 console interaction, and Valve configuration formats using modern C# and .NET.",
